<title>USA: Checkers says debt talks continue.</title>
<headline>Checkers says debt talks continue.</headline>
<dateline>CLEARWATER, Fla. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Checkers Drive-In Restaurants Inc said on Friday that talks on the company's debt restructuring are continuing and default waivers on the company's debt have been extended through September 16, 1996.</p>
<p>A capital management firm had completed the acquisition of Checkers Drive-In's outstanding debt under a credit facility.</p>
<p>Checkers respresentatives were not immediately available for comment.</p>
